Duke Valarken's attempt to usurp the power of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate's</a> Council of Four, in which he staged a failed coup backed by a cult of lycanthropes called the Band of the Red Moon. There are several notes in the margins in <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash's</a> precise handwriting, with the following scrawled in the endpaper: 'Two lessons - First, assassination alone isn't enough, and second, Duke <a href=\"/wiki/Dillard_Portyr\" title=\"Dillard Portyr\">Dillard Portyr</a> lived through this, so don't underestimate him.']\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715003925\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1340/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24686/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6633/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931108/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.917      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   37.917      1 -total\n 50.26%   19.059      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.46%   16.859     15 Template:Trim\n 23.83%    9.037      2 Template:Uid\n 16.81%    6.375      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.29%    5.417      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.62%    4.027      1 Template:Books\n  9.89%    3.748      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.54%    3.618      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12456-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715003925 and revision id 364871. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}